	"data": "Concept: Feedback Layer\n\n\"Take note of this, Calcifer. I would like this. Whatever view I'm on, on desktop, on phone, just keep note of the context, the device. Leave feedback and it could just be general, or click on a specific element.\" — cithoreal, May 2026\n\nWhat It Is\n\nA modular, portable feedback system that can be dropped into any project. Not deeply integrated — its own React module. Any interface, any device, any context → instant feedback capture with full context.\n\nDesign…",
